  "title": "Li Auto Inc. Launches the All-New Li L8, a Five-Seat Flagship SUV",
  "summary": "BEIJING, June 23, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Li Auto Inc. (“Li Auto” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: LI; HKEX: 2015), a leader in China’s new energy vehicle market, today officially launched the all-new Li L8, with deliveries to commence within this week. The vehicle is available in Ultra and Livis trims,",
